# Skills Resolver

## Purpose

Route Intents to owning Skills.

## Routes

### Example

| Intent | Capability |
|---|---|
| Verify a write | `pos-verify` |

## Routing Rules

Read the owning Skill before acting.

## Maintenance

Run the resolver check after every change.
